      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today, we’re announcing our research on Genie 4, our new world model that brings unprecedented realism and native audio to real-time interactive simulation.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/google-deepmind/introducing-genie-4/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T01:14:30.949Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The Genie 4 model incorporates and builds on capabilities from the Gemini family: Gemini Omni anchors simulations in real-world appearance and behavior, while other Gemini models provide the complex reasoning needed to help maintain a simulation’s coherence and continuity.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/google-deepmind/introducing-genie-4/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T01:14:30.949Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With Genie 4, you can set an event in motion and steer scenes in real time using natural language, like moving the camera, changing the weather, or introducing new characters.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/google-deepmind/introducing-genie-4/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T01:14:30.949Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Every world also generates native audio on the fly, including ambient sounds, music, and interactive dialogue.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/google-deepmind/introducing-genie-4/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-28T01:14:30.949Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We have started rolling out Genie 4 to a limited group of trusted testers.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/google-deepmind/introducing-genie-4/",
        "source": "Google (The Keyword · AI)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z",
